    text: "Affected stops:\r\nS Pearl St & Florida Ave (#15800) (northbound)\r\nS Pearl St & Louisiana Ave (#15808) (southbound)\r\nS Pearl St & Florida Ave (#15801) (southbound)\r\n\nFor northbound Route 12 get on/off buses at:\r\nIowa Ave & S Washington St (#14593)\r\nLouisiana / Pearl Station Gate A (#15056)\r\n\nFor southbound Route 12 get on/off buses at:\r\nLouisiana / Pearl Station Gate B (#21467)\r\nIowa Ave & S Pearl St (#14592)"
